                    "queryText": "SELECT CAST(time / 86400 AS INTEGER) * 86400 AS day, sum(waitedMs) AS waited\nFROM call\nWHERE answer IS NOT NULL AND time >= $__from / 1000 AND time < $__to / 1000\nGROUP BY day\nORDER BY day",
